WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.944
You've been talking about the move for three months. You might not have noticed.

2
00:00:06.244 --> 00:00:10.346
Your journal did. Threads appear on their own, named in your own words.

3
00:00:11.646 --> 00:00:16.345
Each one shows how often it comes up, when you last talked about it, and what you said.

4
00:00:17.645 --> 00:00:21.977
Tap it, and there's every entry about the move, newest first.

5
00:00:23.277 --> 00:00:29.958
It's a guess, so it's yours to fix. Rename it, or hide it. Nothing is deleted.

6
00:00:31.258 --> 00:00:35.604
It's all found on your phone. Threads is at the top of your journal.
